# TOEIC Vocabulary Day54

| 단어 | 의미 | 예문 |
|---|---|---|
| accurate | 정확한 | Please provide accurate information. |
| efficiently | 효율적으로 | The machine operates efficiently. |
| promptly | 즉시, 신속하게 | We will respond promptly. |
| reliable | 신뢰할 수 있는 | The system is reliable. |
| temporarily | 일시적으로 | The office is temporarily closed. |
| significantly | 상당히 | Sales increased significantly. |
| convenient | 편리한 | The location is convenient. |
| confidential | 기밀의 | This document is confidential. |
| currently | 현재 | The position is currently available. |
| approximately | 약, 대략 | The meeting will last approximately one hour. |

### 암기 포인트
- accurate information: 정확한 정보
- operate efficiently: 효율적으로 작동하다
- respond promptly: 신속하게 대응하다
- temporarily closed: 일시적으로 폐쇄된
- confidential document: 기밀 문서
- approximately: 수치 앞에서 ‘약’
